  "port": 3000,
  "projectDescription": "El Carot is a tarot deck of the 22 major arcana, where each arcanum is embodied by a beloved character whose name starts with C — hence el C-arot. Charly García is El Loco, Cleopatra is La Sacerdotisa, Celia Cruz is El Sol, Coco Chanel is El Juicio, and so on. The artwork keeps the classic Rider–Waite compositions but collages each figure's face into the scene, printed in a warm, aged, hand-pressed style.\n\nThis design system powers the El Carot website/app: a single, intimate flow where a visitor fans through the deck, draws a card, watches it turn over, reads its meaning and quote, and can share it, save it as a wallpaper, or leave a login-free comment. It is mobile-first (the original mockups are iPhone screens); a desktop adaptation is included.",
  "projectTitle": "El Carot",
  "provider": "claude",
  "proxy": {
    "controlPort": 14199,
    "dbPort": 14101,
    "httpPort": 14100,
    "httpsPassthrough": [],
    "httpsPreview": false
  },
  "runnerTimeout": {
    "floorSeconds": 900,
    "headroomSeconds": 90,
    "mode": "auto"
  },
  "scenarios": {
    "dir": ".codeyam/scenarios"
  },
